  m_Name: Carta_SmartGrid
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Smart Grid
  _titleEn: Smart Grid
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Uma rede el\xE9trica inteligente usa medidores e sensores para equilibrar
    gera\xE7\xE3o e consumo em tempo real e isolar falhas rapidamente."
  _summaryEn: A smart grid uses meters and sensors to balance generation and demand
    in real time and isolate faults quickly.
  _realWorld: "Redes inteligentes est\xE3o sendo implantadas em v\xE1rios pa\xEDses
    para integrar energia solar e e\xF3lica, que variam ao longo do dia."
  _realWorldEn: Smart grids are being rolled out in many countries to integrate solar
    and wind power, which vary over the day.
  _tradeOffs: "A troca de medidores custa caro, os dados de consumo revelam h\xE1bitos
    das casas, e a rede fica exposta a ataques digitais."
  _tradeOffsEn: Replacing meters is expensive, consumption data reveals household
    habits, and the grid becomes exposed to cyberattacks.
  _sources:
